  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of the Freeway Traffic Information Management Systems in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Estalish the framework of toll road information system. Data collection, Provide equipment for data integration, Capacity building for the officers, Pilot test for the toll road information system</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the efficiency of road access, road usage, and traffic safety by providing real-time traffic information, construction information, maintenance information, and other live event notification for road users.&#xc778;&#xb3c4;&#xb124;&#xc2dc;&#xc544; &#xc720;&#xb8cc;&#xb3c4;&#xb85c; &#xd655;&#xcda9;&#xacc4;&#xd68d;(2020-2024 &#xc911;&#xc7a5;&#xae30; &#xad6d;&#xac00;&#xac1c;&#xbc1c;&#xacc4;&#xd68d;, 2,500km &#xc720;&#xb8cc;&#xb3c4;&#xb85c; &#xc2e0;&#xc124; &#xbaa9;&#xd45c;)&#xc5d0; &#xb530;&#xb978; &#xc720;&#xb8cc;&#xb3c4;&#xb85c; &#xd1b5;&#xd569; &#xc815;&#xbcf4; &#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c; &#xad6c;&#xcd95; &#xbc0f; &#xad00;&#xb9ac;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
